AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:dph") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:kva") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:pt") Annotation(rdfs:comment "PMID:27812932") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0004008> "p has primary output c if (a) p has output c and (b) the goal of process is to modify, produce, or transform c.")
